    sub: rdfs:label "Streichan et al. (2018), Mayer et al. (2010), Lefebvre et al. (2023) & Brauns et al. (2024) Drosophila global morphogenetic flow, curved-surface active nematic myosin mechanics & cell intercalation — Morphometric validation 86/100" ;
